{"seq":3,"slug":"popular-and-memoirs","title":"科普与回忆录","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/popular-and-memoirs","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"surely-youre-joking-and-memoirs","title":"《别闹了，费曼先生！》与回忆录","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/popular-and-memoirs/surely-youre-joking-and-memoirs","wordCount":1365,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-character-of-physical-law","title":"《物理定律的本性》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/popular-and-memoirs/the-character-of-physical-law","wordCount":1397,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"科普与回忆录\">科普与回忆录</h1><p>本章呈现费曼面向大众的著作——风靡全球的回忆录与科普演讲集。正是这些作品，使费曼从物理学界的传奇，变成了家喻户晓的文化偶像。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档介绍《别闹了，费曼先生！》等回忆录，如何以幽默的轶事塑造了一个游戏人生、蔑视虚伪的&quot;科学顽童&quot;形象。第二篇文档介绍《物理定律的本性》等科普演讲集，如何向大众传达物理学的深层之美与方法之妙。</p>\n"}